  "question": {
    "text": "The number density of molecules of a gas depends on their distance r from the origin as, <math><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> Then the numer of molecules is proportional to:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "6hUnl",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
