  "solution": {
    "text": "Density of molecules of gas as a of r is, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msup></math><br />Total no. of molecules <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></munderover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></math><br /><math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br />To integrate this, substitute <math><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi></math> this will give us <math><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></math><br />Now, the integration will become, <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math><br />This shows that the numer of molecules is proportional to <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math>",
    "image": null
  },
